      "message": "Yeah - I suspect there will be some cases we\u0027ll want to Precompile but I\u0027m a bit skeptical re the generality of the Chrome stories used to generate this set. Regardless of how we express it in the Precompile API I would like to get some actual UMA stats to guide which AnalyticClip Pipelines we generate.",
